        "*Su dormitorio* can mean 'his bedroom', 'her bedroom', 'their bedroom' or 'your (formal) bedroom'. How does a listener work out which? Write a two-sentence mini-dialogue where the context makes it clear. Then explain why it's *mis cortinas* even when only one person owns them, but *nuestra habitación* even when four people share it.",
